  "prefLabel": "He-P 401.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 401.01 Purpose. The purpose of this rule is to promote greater patient safety in the delivery of health care and to reduce medical errors by encouraging physicians to improve quality of care through effective and continuing quality assurance programs.\n\nSource. #7694, eff 6-4-02; ss by #9719, eff 6-4-10",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p400.html"
